				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				143,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Add funding acknowledgement section with grant details\n\nExpand the Funding & Acknowledgements section in README.md with a narrative paragraph describing Land as an NLnet NGI0 Commons Fund open-source endeavor, and add a structured table header row identifying Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and NGI0 Commons Fund. Normalize all GitHub blob links to tree links for consistency with the existing link style.\n\n- Insert introductory paragraph before the funding acknowledgement block\n- Add `<thead>` with organization-name headers above the existing logo row\n- Lowercase the Land website URL to match the PlayForm and NLnet URL style\n- Switch LICENSE and CHANGELOG anchor links from `/blob/` to `/tree/`\n- Reword the Changelog paragraph to include an invitation tone\n- Remove the separate PlayForm steward sentence, folding the context into the NLnet project page reference\n\nAll changes are cosmetic documentation improvements with no functional impact.",
